Recommends: i2c-tools
Description: Publish Enviro+ sensor readings to MQTT
 Reads Pimoroni Enviro+ sensors (BME280, LTR559, gas, optional PMS5003)
 and publishes them to an MQTT broker with Home Assistant discovery.
 Bundles its Python dependencies in /opt/venvs/enviroplus-mqtt.
